Charge conservation is immediate: $Q(p)+Q(\pi^+)=1+1=2=Q(\Delta^{++}).$ The rough mass balance also permits the decay: $1200\,\mathrm{MeV}
>
940\,\mathrm{MeV}+140\,\mathrm{MeV}.$ There is enough energy left for kinetic energy in the final state.

